{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此〈普賢品〉名平等因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〈如來出現品〉名平等果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但此\n會在八禪天說，經文未至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "百萬名兆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即極東方金燈雲幢世界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如平等住風輪，有須彌山微塵數持上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如普光海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如蕋香幢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如下華藏世界海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上方盡際"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如寶光明種上二十層等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如蕋香幢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如普光海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如殊勝威光藏等須彌山微塵數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下方第二世界海也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下方至極"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上下孤豎如軸，八方周輳如幅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下本文亦未全，尚有十品存於天竺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泉"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本載天冊皇帝並沙門慧研序二章然續藏經第五套中既載該序故今省之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301002", "type": "orig", "text": "順疑願"}
{"id": null, "n": "0302001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0302001", "type": "orig", "text": "修上疑脫主字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0302002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0302002", "type": "orig", "text": "者疑音"}
{"id": null, "n": "0303001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0303001", "type": "orig", "text": "自當作目"}
{"id": null, "n": "0303002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0303002", "type": "orig", "text": "驗疑眾"}
{"id": null, "n": "0303003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0303003", "type": "orig", "text": "聖疑勝"}
{"id": null, "n": "0303004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0303004", "type": "orig", "text": "拔疑技"}
{"id": null, "n": "0303005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0303005", "type": "orig", "text": "以字更勘"}
